<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:116%"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">-If receipts unclear/incorrect attachment use: -</span></span></i></b><br />
<br />
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">I wanted to let you know that unfortunately we are unable to assess your claim based on the receipts you have provided. </span></span><br />
<br />
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Please send us&nbsp;<b><i>-advise what is required-</i></b>&nbsp;at your earliest convenience by replying to this email.</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:116%"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">-If receipts do not match information in the case use: -</span></span></i></b><br />
<br />
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">I wanted to let you know that the information in the receipts you have provided is not related to the flights that were impacted in your itinerary. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:116%"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Please send us&nbsp;<b><i>-advise what is required-</i></b>&nbsp;at your earliest convenience by replying to this email.</span></span><br />
<br />
<b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">We're here to help</span></span></b><br />
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">If you have travel insurance, please let us know if you require an insurance letter to confirm details of your trip.</span></span></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</p>
